aneinferno"}," ",{"t":"NaneInferno","r":"weapon:naneinferno"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-AnteChamber.png","w":10,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ante Chamber DLC to access"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-FireFall.png","w":20,"h":24,"r":"weapon:firefall"}," ",{"t":"FireFall","r":"weapon:firefall"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheBloodmoon.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Bloodmoon DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-FireBall.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:fireball"}," ",{"t":"FireBall","r":"weapon:fireball"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheBloodmoon.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Bloodmoon DLC to access"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-FireWall.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:firewall"}," ",{"t":"FireWall","r":"weapon:firewall"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheBloodmoon.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Bloodmoon DLC to access"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-FireStall.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:firestall"}," ",{"t":"FireStall","r":"weapon:firestall"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-LegacyOfTheBloodmoon.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Legacy of the Bloodmoon DLC to access"}]}]},{"k":"p","c":["He can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["As with all characters that gain benefits from leveling up, Dario benefits most from starting with ",{"i":"Sprite-Wicked_Season_(XIII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"}," ",{"t":"Wicked Season (XIII)","r":"arcana:wicked-season-xiii"},". The ",{"i":"Sprite-Crown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:crown"}," ",{"t":"Crown","r":"passive:crown"}," and some Curse-boosting items are also advisable. One of those is ",{"i":"Sprite-Torrona's_Box.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:torrona-s-box"}," ",{"t":"Torrona's Box","r":"passive:torrona-s-box"},", which naturally synergizes with Dario's playstyle as it evolves the Flames of Misspell."]},{"c":["Because Dario's ability gives a flat base damage boost, he benefits more from weapons with low base damage that can output attacks quickly than weapons with high base power, which won't scale as well. He is one of the best users of Svarog Statue for this reason, as its main drawback is usually that its damage is extremely weak in the lategame. For the same reason Hellfire may be suboptimal as it's a high-damage, low-hit rate weapon."]},{"c":["If Svarog Statue is picked, one might also want to consider using ",{"i":"Sprite-Wings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:wings"}," ",{"t":"Wings","r":"passive:wings"}," to maximize the trail of fire, which also can evolve the ",{"i":"Sprite-Shadow_Pinion.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"}," ",{"t":"Shadow Pinion","r":"weapon:shadow-pinion"}," into the fire-based Valkyrie Turner, and then united into the ",{"i":"Sprite-Darkness_Illusion.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:darkness-illusion"}," ",{"t":"Darkness Illusion","r":"weapon:darkness-illusion"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},"."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Heart_of_Fire_(XIX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," ",{"t":"Heart of Fire (XIX)","r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," can be a decent Arcana to pick, as it affects most of the weapons Dario's boost works on, and the explosions given from this arcana are boosted as well, increasing Dario's options for weapons."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Heir_of_Fate_(XIX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:heir-of-fate-xix"}," ",{"t":"Heir of Fate (XIX)","r":"arcana:heir-of-fate-xix"}," Is an incredibly solid pick, as it synergises greatly with Dario's boost."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Dario_Bossi.png","w":106,"h":120,"c":["Dario Bossi's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Dario_Bossi.gif","w":102,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]},{"i":"Unlock-Dario_Bossi.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Secrets menu icon"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Dario Bossi","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Dario_Bossi"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}